WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
Today your child hears which of the two letters starts a word.

2
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.359
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.859 --> 00:00:10.327
Each picture has its word under it, with the first letter missing.

4
00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:15.180
Say the name of the first picture. Bug. Ask: what is the first sound?

5
00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:17.767
Bat first, then ball.

6
00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:21.956
The word is bug.

7
00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.078
Here is one with the other letter. Dog.

8
00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:28.691
The round part first, then up and down.

9
00:00:32.088 --> 00:00:33.143
The word is dog.

10
00:00:34.043 --> 00:00:37.763
Do two pictures together. Then your child carries on with the page.

11
00:00:38.213 --> 00:00:44.494
For job two, press play on your child's sound track and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

12
00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.456
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
